},{"client_msg_id":"373d8765-a4f5-4512-afea-e60559a554fb","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"\u003chttps://about.sourcegraph.com/blog/zoekt-memory-optimizations-for-sourcegraph-cloud/\u003e\nこの記事の\n```// shrinkUint32Slice copies slices with excess capacity to precisely sized ones\n// to avoid wasting memory. It should be used on slices with long static durations.\nfunc shrinkUint32Slice(a []uint32) []uint32 {\n       if cap(a)-len(a) \u0026lt; 32 {\n               return a\n       }\n       out := make([]uint32, len(a))\n       copy(out, a)\n       return out\n}```\nこれもそういう用途なんでしょうね。","ts":"1631173766.122000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"MHQ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d29fd2d3-908a-46de-8dd1-201a7c773339","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"slice から要素を消すコードでループの中が\n```a[i] = a[len(a)-1]\na = a[:len(a)-1]```\nて感じのがありますがあれも、ポインタの配列の様な場合に\n```a[i] = a[len(a)-1]\na[len(a)-1] = nil\na = a[:len(a)-1]```\nってしないと参照が残ったままになってリークぽくなりますね。","ts":"1631172683.121000","edited":{"user":"U03C6TEAZ","ts":"1631172804.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"/tQTh"}]},{"client_msg_id":"02a3f244-e31d-48b6-9d48-853d3c551786","type":"message","user":"UERCTTT8B","text":"じゃあなんにせよ参照生きてないとだめだな","ts":"1631167942.119900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"HcXH"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a308ee68-071f-4611-8338-0b3e90e45ea6","type":"message","user":"UERCTTT8B","text":"ほんとだ、そんなことできたんだ","ts":"1631167935.119700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"FQqv"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c72c2f8e-bf0f-4e58-b6d8-29024fed4bd4","type":"message","user":"UERCTTT8B","text":"len 伸ばしてアクセスできましたっけ?","ts":"1631167876.119400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"77VZ0"}]},{"client_msg_id":"44f73af8-7183-42dd-a859-10b4745f581b","type":"message","user":"UA4RVLHK7","text":"配列が本体で、スライスはあくまでもその view でしかないという理解","ts":"1631167082.119000","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"sorena","count":1,"users":["U06BRP8VD"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"nSsl"}]},{"client_msg_id":"24190b24-9a8a-4756-863a-df0f8e6d78ea","type":"message","user":"U7H4TJEG0","text":"ですね","ts":"1631167072.118700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"CCj"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1edd8cad-37f0-4c8b-9970-e02a2b37112a","type":"message","user":"UA4RVLHK7","text":"len 以上 cap 未満の場所にあるデータも、lenを伸ばせばアクセスできるんですよね。","ts":"1631167056.118400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"10XN"}]},{"client_msg_id":"507d8ddf-4346-4662-999d-a965070cfb98","type":"message","user":"UA4RVLHK7","text":"\u003chttps://go-tour-jp.appspot.com/moretypes/11\u003e","ts":"1631167012.117500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"45+ll"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7c80e286-1735-4393-a712-5132fd1ba68d","type":"message","user":"U7H4TJEG0","text":"`x := []*int{new(int)}[:0]; x = x[:1]`","ts":"1631166961.117300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"dx3z"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3e63744d-f762-4f4d-8ad8-191c3351a23f","type":"message","user":"U7H4TJEG0","text":"sliceとしても `x[:len(x)+1]` のようにしたときに `x[len(x)]` がGCされていると困りそう","ts":"1631166851.116900","edited":{"user":"U7H4TJEG0","ts":"1631166857.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"TooPb"}]},{"client_msg_id":"59c5bc9a-ba46-4c25-8b8e-e836c74c7ea2","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"sliceとしてはそうなんですけどunderlyingな配列としてはそうでは